hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1431","Ahmad bin Ali bin Wahb told us, my uncle told us, Abdullah bin Omar told us, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Abdullah bin Omar, that the Messenger of God May God’s prayers and peace be upon him, he used to go out on the two Eids with Al-Fadl bin Abbas, Abdullah bin Abbas, Al-Abbas, Ali, Ja’far, and Al-Hasan. And Al-Hussein, and Usama bin Zaid, and Zaid bin Haritha, and Ayman bin Umm Ayman, raising his voice with Tahlil and Takbeer, and he takes the path \The blacksmiths until he comes to the place of prayer. Then when he finishes"," he returns to his shoes until he comes to his house.\"""""
